Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-tk, tk-html3 (>= 3.0+git20260919)
Recommends: python3-pil.imagetk
Description: HTML and CSS widgets for Tkinter (TkinterWeb)
 TkinterWeb puts the Tkhtml widget into Tkinter: HtmlFrame (a scrolling page with links, forms,
 images and a DOM for Python), HtmlLabel and HtmlText. Pages are HTML 4 and CSS 2.1, without
 JavaScript; the application can catch link clicks (on_link_click) and handle its own URL schemes.
 .
 It loads the system's Tkhtml 3.0 (tk-html3) instead of the binaries the PyPI release bundles.
 PNG and GIF images need nothing more; JPEG and the rest go through Pillow (python3-pil.imagetk).
